WOW-BG3 benilla patch 0110: a stand-in the party's attack misses plays WoW's dodge.
Playtest feedback: "when an NPC dodges / I miss an attack, they should play their dodge animation." BG3 raises MissedBy for an
attack roll that missed; strikes.bin flags 2|64 (Mirrors.lua) carry it. The model plays what WoW's client does with a
dodged swing: DefenseAnim (the swing's $CPP) and a SwingImpact with HITINFO_MISS, victim state 2 and no floating text,
both written directly because the own character is hidden and plays no clip with those keys. An older benilla drops the record (damage 0).
